Source landscape note: the 2023 Tinubu 3B source universe is dominated by human-rights NGO reporting, UN treaty-body material, Nigeria-specific court/panel coverage, official presidency statements on security incidents and policing, and a smaller set of academic and reputable local-news analyses on protest policing, detention, killings, disappearances, and insecurity. I found a broad mix of favorable, adverse, and mixed leads, including several direct remedies/oversight documents and several evidence-heavy retrospective pieces on #EndSARS, Tudun Biri, Southeast violence, and protest repression.

